"The frog man Genzo is a transmigrator from another world, where a falling meteor killed him."
"Some beastfolk who evolved from monsters began as transmigrators born into monster bodies."
"Most transmigrators land in monster bodies, and are found only if they learn to communicate."
"The Nameless Hell Hound carries the memories of Lisha, a girl of Earth, and hides them."
"The Nameless Hell Hound's human Veilform is shaped from those Earth memories."
"The Vulpyr who travels with the Hell Hound pack follows a secret System quest of her own."
